						 <div style="text-align: right;"></div> <div style="text-align: center;"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/peak/everest-new-blue.jpg" width="1200" alt="everest-new-blue.jpg" class="image" /></div> <p><br /></p> <p>I<br /> Go<br /> Far<br /> In my<br /> Break<br /> To best<br /> What lay<br /> Unbeaten.<br /> She scorns<br /> Me, her stark<br /> Face, glacial<br /> Hand, freezing<br /> Head. But I stick<br /> My axe in the ribs<br /> Of a man who sought<br /> Before to overtake<br /> The top, and I spot her.<br /> I stabilize and touch<br /> The summit, and grin mad.<br /> While I laugh, I glance<br /> Down, and see my field<br /> Of colored jackets,<br /> Hats, and crampons.<br /> They face down in<br /> Red patches. She<br /> Howls in a gust<br /> Of wind, rises<br /> Past my eyes,<br /> And I slump<br /> Down, down.<br /> In this, I<br /> Can see<br /> On. She<br /> Grew<br /> Now<br /> By<br /> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5140">2</a></p> <p><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /></p> <div style="text-align: center;"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/peak/climber.jpg" width="1200" alt="climber.jpg" class="image" /></div> <p><br /></p> <div class="licensebox22"> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">‡&nbsp;Licensing&nbsp;/&nbsp;Citation</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">‡&nbsp;Hide&nbsp;Licensing&nbsp;/&nbsp;Citation</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>Cite this page as:</p> <p>For more information, see <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/licensing-guide">Licensing Guide</a>.<br /> <strong>Licensing Disclosures</strong></p> <div class="content-separator" style="display: none:"></div> <bl