&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-CASH4D-J: &amp;quot;The People Person&amp;quot;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
When standing on the shoulders of giants, it&#039;s best to not look down.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/this-page-intentionally-left-blank/Cash.png&quot; alt=&quot;Cash.png&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt;
