&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid black; padding: 12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;05/09/2009:&lt;/strong&gt; An I&amp;amp;T investigation determines the anomalous nature of the character string and it is transferred from Barkley to Eileen Veiksaar, Chief of I&amp;amp;T. Dr. Elstrom claims, under MARSTON verification protocol, to have no memory of the source of her former password. This claim is verified.&lt;/td&gt;
