					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5197</guid>
				<title>SCP-5197</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5197</link>
				<description>

&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Item #:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5197&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Object Class:&lt;/strong&gt; Euclid&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Special Containment Procedures&lt;/strong&gt;: SCP-5197 is the be kept in a 70x70x70&amp;quot; in site- room with the walls and floor being covered with bright phycadellic patterned carpet and a pannel ceiling with only one outlet. and is to be plugged in constantly in the case of a power outage the walls should be covered with steel gates and are to stay closed for thirty (30) minutes after the power is restablished.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5197 is an arcade cabinet with dimensions of 3.0x7.5x2.0&amp;quot; feet with a label reading &amp;quot;cabinet man&amp;quot; testing has shown that the machine has the heart, brain, lungs, and what seems to be the spirit of a human male. conversation with the cabinet has given us detail of how he was created. he refuses to give further detail. the game played is a racing game similar to Pole Position but with the difference of an extra player who is controlled by the machine itself who will attempt to cause all other players to lose. when he inevitably wins he will sing a small song that goes as follows &amp;quot;you cant win me I cant be beat I wont hurt you unless you cheat you cant see me behind the screen im half human and half machine&amp;quot; cheating will cause the machine to shut down and show the face of a man on the screen he will then proceed to protrude wires through the sides of himself and impale the player through the abdomen. always killing the subject.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-smiles-official&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5350118&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1607655035&quot; alt=&quot;dr_smiles_official&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5350118)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-smiles-official&quot;  &gt;dr_smiles_official&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
